{
  "slug": "pinecone",
  "name": "Pinecone",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Pinecone vector database integration. Streamline your Pinecone development with powerful tools for managing vector indexes, querying data, and rapid prototyping. Use slash commands like /quickstart to generate AGENTS.md files and initialize Python projects and /query to quickly explore indexes. Access the Pinecone MCP server for creating, describing, upserting and querying indexes with Claude. Perfect for developers building semantic search, RAG applications, recommendation systems, and other vector-based applications with Pinecone.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**, **1 command**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `assistant` (Create, manage, and chat with Pinecone Assistants for document Q&A with citations), `cli` (Guide for using the Pinecone CLI (pc) to manage Pinecone resources from the terminal), `docs` (Curated documentation reference for developers building with Pinecone), `full-text-search` (Create, ingest into, and query a Pinecone full-text-search (FTS) document index using the graduated document-schema API (Python SDK…), `help` (Overview of all available Pinecone skills and what a user needs to get started), `mcp` (Reference for the Pinecone MCP server tools), `n8n` (Build n8n workflows using the Pinecone Assistant node or Pinecone Vector Store node), `query` (Query integrated indexes using text with Pinecone MCP), and 1 more\n- **Commands** (1): `join-discord` (Opens a link to join the Pinecone Discord, allowing users to learn from each other, contact the Pinecone…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `pinecone`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pinecone@claude-plugins-official` from `pinecone-io/pinecone-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 9,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 1,
    "mcp": 1
